-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The cousin and childhood friend of protagonist Erika (Minato). She is the real “Erika Ikusa” and mastermind behind the cross-dressing Minato. Minato goes to school in her place as she is a natural-born shut-in who would rather stay at home and play video games. A self-deprecating cynic, she comes off as harsh towards Minato, but loves him in reality."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88133"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d047001e4837d213871d71ca5cdaba2885c4983af3793e415512ea19101228a6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/ea58418ce91c77c940f799b090fb710a36c9b949903200222582def2fce6e92c.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川上 ゆき","creatorId":"vndb:s19167","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19167","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19167","name":"川上 ゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83704","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c88134","characterName":"鬼灯 リラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c88134"},"originalCharacterName":"鬼灯 リラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl with the appearance of an angel, but who is actually devilish and charismatic. With her ingenious fashion sense and makeup skills, she is also a popular fashion model among high school girls. While she has a sharp tongue in that she calls the other students “weeds,” she is also sincere in that she never laughs at the strides of others. In fact, she is actually a secret otaku to a very extreme degree."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88134"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8ce4184ed463ea72e21c6d735d2464f8309d885b4d0a6fe7b147f6e81a8cc90e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16dbd50c624d24a08ccc7447d273c8355d9d772420f5c90d280c502bc31812bb.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"河瀬 茉希","creatorId":"vndb:s20398","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20398","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20398","name":"河瀬 茉希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83707","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c88135","characterName":"龍宮院ウラン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c88135"},"originalCharacterName":"龍宮院ウラン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An easygoing girl with long black hair, who wears a haori and does things at her own pace. She gives off an “old Japan atmosphere” to an extreme degree, specializing in things from flower arrangements to tea ceremonies, Japanese-style dancing, and koto. However, since she was raised in isolation from secular society, she has had no ties to men or western culture until now, and cannot bake or speak English."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88135"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/aed9de4121de1f11e6fb4f3ad8f80d0f0646f49eb27f7f6da66d6c8df9b9b7ab.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6f08a6c1499572d6e2928ebe630b3978e35060efac7818407a71cd393fd6d2c3.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"credite